{"ticker":{"symbol":"007660.KS","name":"이수페타시스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":84100.0,"change_pct":0.025609756097561,"market_cap":6173715070976.0,"pe":13.699985,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.0027348394768133173,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":164400.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"South Korea","city":"Daegu","employees":1061,"website":"https://www.petasys.com","business_summary":"ISU Petasys Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells printed circuit boards (PCBs). The company offers network equipment, including router/switch and backplane; server/storage PCB; supercomputer high-performance computing PCB; aerospace PCB; and IC testers, including probe card, load board, and burn-in board. It also provides advanced driver assistance system RF radar PCBs; and radio frequency (RF) PCBs. The company was formerly known as Petasys Co., Ltd. and changed its name to ISU Petasys Co., Ltd. in March 2002. ISU Petasys Co., Ltd. was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Daegu, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"이수페타시스(주)는 인쇄회로기판(PCB)을 제조, 판매하는 회사입니다. 이 회사는 라우터/스위치 및 백플레인을 포함한 네트워크 장비를 제공합니다. 서버/스토리지 PCB; 슈퍼컴퓨터 고성능 컴퓨팅 PCB; 항공우주 PCB; 프로브 카드, 로드 보드, 번인 보드를 포함한 IC 테스터. 또한 고급 운전자 지원 시스템인 RF 레이더 PCB도 제공합니다. 및 무선 주파수(RF) PCB. 이 회사는 이전에 Petasys Co., Ltd.로 알려졌으며 2002년 3월에 ISU Petasys Co., Ltd.로 상호를 변경했습니다. ISU Petasys Co., Ltd.는 1972년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 대구에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":1661118950000.0,"rev_lo":1585674190000.0,"rev_hi":1811409570000.0,"rev_g":0.5257,"n":14,"eps":3759.1716,"eps_lo":3342.0842,"eps_hi":4197.972,"eps_g":0.65019995},{"period":"2027","rev":2384285140000.0,"rev_lo":1830900000000.0,"rev_hi":3254000000000.0,"rev_g":0.7996,"n":15,"eps":6138.693,"eps_lo":4341.0,"eps_hi":7740.0,"eps_g":0.633}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"전자부품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":642920533260.0,"operating_income":116618143850.0,"net_income":102473038000.0,"eps":1546.660516},{"period":"202